        jTextPane1.setText("Help Page Welcome to the Quick Loan application! This guide will help you navigate through the different pages and features of our application.  Register Page The Register Page allows new users to create an account. Here’s how you can use it:  Email: Enter a valid email address. This will be used for account-related notifications. Password: Create a secure password. Make sure it is a combination of letters, numbers, and symbols for enhanced security. Confirm Password: Re-enter your password to confirm it matches. Submit: Click on the 'Register' button to create your account. If you encounter any issues with registration, please check your email for verification instructions or ensure that all fields are filled out correctly.  Login Page The Login Page is for existing users to access their accounts. Follow these steps:  Email: Enter the email address you used during registration. Password: Enter your password. Ensure it matches the one you created during registration. Login: Click on the 'Login' button to access your account. If you see a login error or a message indicating incorrect credentials, double-check that you have entered the correct email and password. If you’ve forgotten your password, please use the password recovery feature.  Home Page The Home Page is the central hub of the Quick Loan application. From here, you can:  View Loan Details: Check the status and details of your loans. Access Loan Processing: Begin the process of applying for a new loan. Update Profile: Edit your account information and settings. If you need assistance with navigating the Home Page, look for tooltips and guidance available throughout the page.  Loan Processing Page The Loan Processing Page allows you to apply for a new loan. Here’s what you need to do:  Fill Out Loan Application: Provide all required information, such as the loan amount, repayment terms, and any necessary personal details. Submit Application: Click on the 'Submit' button to send your application for processing. After submission, you will receive a confirmation and your application will be reviewed. If there are any issues or additional information needed, you will be contacted via email.");
